+### Slice — single-command launcher composition (under LBE-INTENT-CLINE-CLI-LBE-RUNTIME-INTEGRATION-001)
+
+```text
+SLICE_ID: LAUNCHER_SINGLE_COMMAND_COMPOSITION
+STATUS: RECORDED (governance bookkeeping only; launcher change is local and unstaged)
+AFFECTED_STRUCTURE: integration repo launcher surfaces only:
+- lbe
+- lbe-cli.ps1
+- compatibility wrappers only if they merely forward
+EXISTING_OWNER:
+- LBE canonical session lifecycle
+- LBE product_entry / CLI control surface
+- Cline provider/settings mechanics
+- existing RealLbeWrapper / client projection
+- existing LBE runtime authorization/execution/receipt/evidence owners
+DESIRED_RESULT:
+all supported lbe launch variants converge on one real composition path:
+workspace -> authoritative LBE session -> real runtime env -> existing provider configuration -> client launch
+NON_GOALS:
+- no new session owner
+- no new provider store
+- no new credential persistence
+- no new runtime
+- no new executor
+- no Textual PREVIEW path as normal launch
+- no publication claim
+AUTHORITY_IMPACT: none. This slice composes existing owners only; it does not create or change
+            session, provider, authorization, execution, receipt, evidence, or completion authority.
+```
